    {
      "id": 9776075768094,
      "title": "ANCLAJE QUÍMICO EPÓXICO SÍSMICO DIMAPOXI E-PLUS 585",
      "handle": "adhesivo-epoxico-dimapoxi-e-plus-385",
      "body_html": "<p><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">El ADHESIVO </span><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">DIMAPOXI E-PLUS</span><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"> es una resina química diseñada para aplicaciones estructurales. Está disponible en cartucho de</span><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"> 585 ml, es compatible con diferentes tipos de barras roscadas y varillas de refuerzo. Este producto cumple con la normativa </span><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">ETA 22/0469 </span><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">y es adecuado para su uso en concreto no fisurado y fisurado, así como en aplicaciones sísmicas categoría C1 y C2.</span></p>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n56uGiV7wAcRN2oFpKFHoaiB9T-R2tAw/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\"><strong>VER FICHA TÉCNICA</strong> </span></span></a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1f_bP7kWK5MRmDg5nQO14TukIuxF3WCSt/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(43, 0, 255);\"><span class=\"OYPEnA font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">VER ENSAYO DE TRACCIÓN  RESPONSABILIDAD SÍSMICA </span></span></strong></a></p>",
